The sound she made was knowing, amused, and completely unimpressed by whatever arrangement Mira and I did or didn't have. She sipped her ale, watching me over the rim of the tankard, and I noticed her hands   strong, capable, with short nails and a small callus on the inside of her right thumb. Hands that worked.

